    "body": "White, but never quiet.\n\nFeatured in Tea Party for LUCY’S Magazine Vol. 86, our Structured Jacket Dress from MORPH I is styled as a contemporary sculptural top — where classic tailoring is pushed into something bolder, sharper, and more directional.\n\nDefined by feather boning, architectural construction, and striking cut-outs, the piece blurs the line between garment and form.\n\nA couture interpretation of modern power dressing.\n\nThe Copper Room by Flying Solo @flyingsolonyc @flyingsolo_pr\nProducer: @lunkestyle\nPhotographer: @rquinterophoto\nTalent/Model: @_palomasuarez @theindustryny\nWardrobe Stylist and Set Designer: @by.denise.milanez\nHMUA: @i.no.u.e\nStylist Assistant: @julianagomes.stylist\n\n#MannattGupta #LucysMagazine #MagazineCover #FashionArt #StructuredDress\n\nfashion editorial, sculptural tailoring, modern couture, structured silhouette, luxury fashion, architectural fashion, contemporary womenswear, white statement look, avant garde fashion, couture craftsmanship",
